  m_text: 'Sugar Plum,

    I hope you''re well installed in your new home. I left
    you a few books that you might enjoy before leaving. Don''t forget to eat well
    or you''ll be all skin and bone!

    You may find a few coins within this letter,
    you could use them to help you out in your first steps. Perhaps try going to
    the forest, go for a stroll, I''m sure you''ll find amazing mushrooms.

    Love,'
